		     subtree from the overlay (stage-overlay-libs copies Maven's runtime closure), so the parent of a
		     group below carries its children. Versions are the WAR's: from the BOM where it manages the
		     artifact, written out where it does not (keep those in step with the WAR, the IT says when not). -->

